  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating sustainable energy transition for decarbonization of manufacturing micro-, small and medium-sized enterprises in India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to facilitate decarbonization by minimizing energy consumption among Indian MSMEs through a combination of integrated energy efficiency measures, energy substitution, and innovative solutions. These efforts aim to decrease environmental impacts while enhancing productivity, competitiveness, and business resilience. By targeting these ambitious goals, the project aims to make significant strides in reducing greenhouse gas emissions and promoting sustainable energy practices among MSMEs.</narrative>
  </description>
